    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 16 Cois Eala to the market, an impressive one-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment which comes to the market in excellent turnkey condition.\n\nIdeally suited to first-time buyers, investors or those looking to downsize, this well-presented apartment offers bright and comfortable accommodation with a practical layout and contemporary finishes throughout. The property has been well maintained and is ready for its new owner to move in and enjoy immediately.\n\nSuperbly located between Rathmines and Portobello, 16 Cois Eala enjoys an enviable position within easy reach of some of Dublin's most popular neighbourhoods and amenities. Camden Street and Grafton Street are both within a few minutes' walk, offering an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops and entertainment venues.\n\nThe property is also ideally positioned for a wide range of local amenities, including Swan Leisure Centre, Swan Shopping Centre, Omniplex Cinema and the iconic Stella Cinema. The Grand Canal is close by, providing a pleasant setting for walks and outdoor activities, while a Dublin Bikes station is conveniently located just across the canal from Cois Eala.\n\nFor commuters, the location is exceptionally well connected. Charlemont Luas Station is approximately a 10-minute walk away, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre and beyond. The area is also served by numerous Dublin Bus routes, offering convenient access throughout the city and to many of Dublin's major colleges and universities.\n\nThe property is particularly well located for students and academics, with convenient transport links to Trinity College Dublin, University College Dublin (UCD) and TU Dublin, making it an excellent choice for those seeking easy access to third-level education.\n\nCombining a highly sought-after location, excellent transport links and an abundance of amenities on the doorstep, 16 Cois Eala is ideally positioned to enjoy all that Dublin city has to offer.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this fine apartment has to offer."
      },
      {
