        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen - 2.73m x 1.82m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.95m x 3.87m\n\n\nBedroom - 2.68m x 4.94m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.68m x 2.28m\n\n\n"
